                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Chicken with Chainguns is a game about a chicken with a chaingun getting revenge on a Fox for destroying their eggs. The game has nice music, easy controls, and other animals and signposts that either give backstory to the game, or help with directions on locating hearts, or other miscellaneous stuff. While the price is a bit expensive for what you get, arguably a flash game, there are far worse games that cost more.\n\nWhile the game has quite a few positives, there's one major negative that ruins all of that, and that is the size of the game. The developer has claimed this game has 228 different rooms, however without the use of a map, you'll spend more than half of your overall time backtracking. This game at most should take less than an hour to complete, Yet I've spent more time than that wondering around revisiting the same room multiple times, added with the slowness of the chicken and the long pause it takes to go from one room to another, this becomes a boring, time consuming game.",
